      "claim": "Other L1 contexts (molsidomine 44±15%, E4031 92.2%, pridopidine high, LY3000328 at least 48.4–66.5%, ritanserin 83%, isoniazid 64.5–100%) all support F ≥ 20%.",
      "card_ids": ["C28","C20","C27","C35","C48","C22","C16","C33","C34","C42","C44","C47"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "The only below-threshold record is a mouse linezolid PopPK estimate (F=0.184), which is species-specific and not transferable to human oral bioavailability for the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C76"]
    }
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [
    {
      "family": "oral_auc_cmax_exposure",
      "applicability": "moderate",
      "direction": "supportive",
      "decision_effect": "no_change",
      "card_ids": ["C134","C141"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule (moclobemide) is present in the supplied records.",
    "L3 provides only Tmax for the moclobemide-related context, not AUC/Cmax magnitude or F.",
    "No query-specific IV-comparison or fasted-state pharmacokinetic study is supplied.",
    "First-pass metabolism and transporter effects for the query are not directly quantified; transfer from reference contexts is inferential.",
    "The only below-threshold record (C76) is a mouse PopPK estimate for linezolid and is not transferable to the query.",
    "Many L3 records concern unrelated molecules and do not bear on the query."
  ],
